<title>Ecuador's security crisis: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ecuador/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ecuador-2026-11-23T03:51:45.198Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:51:45 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;US forces have begun their first land operation against cartels in Ecuador while expanding military activities across Latin America, and Ecuadorian fishermen have sued the United States over a drone strike that sank their boat near the Galápagos. President Noboa has asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid and met with Pete Hegseth to discuss anti-narco cooperation. Prison gangs in Ecuador are sending bills to families of inmates, and Noboa has rejected claims that former vice president Jorge Glas was tortured, saying his injuries were self-inflicted. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxQaVlsN2FuNE82VGp2ZXBmTF9Odkk0OU5waE5qUGdMZnRRNjRtQlVWaTg4encxV1NiMU9FTWh4TnVLc09DN1dLOWlRRHczUDBsWjEzdk9vdzY2N0VldVlXdTBSQXBha3pfb3RrMDE4LUctbHE4eWxxbXRLVktPM28wZlZrNWpQcVM1WHF0bEl4MXdpdTZONVBsUzkwMGxmRHFPNTBiaFQ1UDNKSjVkd2JqVlRqclkzUWVPX09qUGxn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQYU0yT2dDTzZkYmtfLTJmSS1UZTNlc0cyWk1vZEpiM3JVNzFRaGdtMHNfNHpJUjRYaEJRU0p1OFlIb1RtU19rczlWclNCaGkxTVJaX2lybVFVa0pSc0stNVU2dFpaUHlMTWw0Y2R5c1d4SVVpS3NZdEY2X0RrWlNGdmJXVEtsSUdGSnJ4VWZEVjlHZHp5ckZkYU5vMDJpU0pnU1Z3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;LatinAmerican Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNcUctcGpibkhlcjBleHltMUtTdm9pNGs2RFR4Y1NaMnNmWEhSaWJsSHEza2Nsd1g1YXVoWHhVVV8wUVBJTjJUam0wcG56ejBMa3BOY3pOYnZxdVZlWHltYmJmNlprbW9TVkVfdk84Wm5mYXZhMHN6NngxTG1kQWs2UTc0bWgwX2d1NWhqekd4SF9zWkE0RjdVeEszeE5rSXRXQk9ta2NTWUJFVzUydFR3V3BHNmlTZ01r?oc=5&quot;&gt;LatinAmerican Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;LatinAmerican Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=